  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1641574947}
  m_Text: 'PATIENT 23 - MILA, 8

    TEST: SILENCE

    She stopped making any sound.

    We cannot find her anymore.


    She is still here.

    She whispers to the ones who fall.'
